commit 6d465446e64e11b7c483f04bfdd18758db94d28b
Author: Ari Jordan <ari.jordan.ch@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Oct 10 12:58:57 2026 +0000

    fix(web): label scripted calls simulated, stop saying "booked", retry busy clinic search

    Browser-verified the React app (/app) with Playwright, Chromium + WebKit, mock and live.

    - Mock phone agent sent callee lines and results without `simulated`, so the
      mock vet/insurer calls showed no "simulated" label (rule 3). The contract now
      requires `simulated` on every phone result; mock callee lines and results set it.
    - Vet result heading said "Appointment booked" / "已预约" and the plan row
      "Booked" for simulated results. Now "Time the vet offered" / "诊所给出的时间"
      and "Simulated slot" / "模拟时段".
    - Live clinic search got HTTP 429 when the voice agent's last care request was
      still running (backend allows one per owner) and showed "Couldn't find clinics".
      It now waits and retries up to 3 times (interim; the durable fix is a
      backend clinic lookup that does not share the care-request lock).
    - Simulated badge no longer stretches full width in result cards.
    - web/e2e/: Playwright walkthroughs (mock path, live path, recorder probe), not in check.sh.

    Red first: new checks in web/scripts/check-agents.mjs and check-clinics.mjs failed before the fix.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Entire-Checkpoint: 01M4JYA9W5T55CZD3FRCNZ8PG8

